msgid ""
"Create an :class:`Open` dialog. :func:`askopenfilename` returns the "
"selected filename as a string, or an empty string if the dialog is "
"cancelled. :func:`askopenfilenames` returns a tuple of the selected "
"filenames, or an empty tuple if cancelled."
